Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Let rij be the reward when you say \[OpenCurlyQuote]i\[CloseCurlyQuote] when \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]j\[CloseCurlyQuote] is true. \[OpenCurlyQuote]j\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] takes values  \[OpenCurlyQuote]1\[CloseCurlyQuote] or \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]2\[CloseCurlyQuote] implying stimulus was in time 1 or 2. \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]i\[CloseCurlyQuote] can take values 0, 1, 2, or 3. 0 implies \
one said stimulus is absent in time 1 and 2. 3 implies one said stimulus is \
present in both time 1 and 2. 1 and 2 implies stimilus present in only 1 or \
only 2respectively. Let p1 with prob of stimulus in time 1. Let pij be the \
prob of saying \[OpenCurlyQuote]i\[CloseCurlyQuote] when \[OpenCurlyQuote]j\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] is true.
cpij is the conditional probability of oi give stimulus in j.
\[Eta]i is the threshold and at time \[OpenCurlyQuote]i\[CloseCurlyQuote].\
\>", "Text",
